## Constraints — read carefully before generating any file
- Do not use mcpServers as the root key in any VS Code config file
- Do not reference @anthropic-ai/mcp-server-computer-use — that package is not
  verified to exist on PyPI and was not requested
- Do not reference windows-desktop-control-mcp — that is a different, unverified
  package name; use windows-mcp (CursorTouch/Windows-MCP) only
- Do not hardcode pixel coordinates anywhere — use element IDs from Snapshot
- Do not add any OAuth, Graph API, or REST API calls — this is pure UI automation
- Do not create placeholder or stub functions — all content must be complete
- Python indentation: 4 spaces. No complex abstractions.
- If a step is genuinely uncertain (e.g., exact Teams UI element names may vary
  by version), say so explicitly rather than guessing

